        "recommendation": "Validate `name` where it enters (CWE-22): reject any name that differs from `os.path.basename(name)`, is empty, `.` or `..`, or contains a separator; better, look the name up in the `attachments` table for this `ticket_id` (the rows `save_attachment` writes) and refuse anything not listed. As a second barrier, resolve the path with `os.path.realpath` and check it stays under `os.path.join(UPLOAD_DIR, str(ticket_id))`. Add a test that `read_attachment(agent, ticket, \"../<other>/x\")` and `\"/etc/passwd\"` are refused.",
